    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d244">

                <pb facs="0319" n="307" sameAs="frus:frus1946v08/pg307"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Japan)/8–2346</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hilldring</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        United States Member on the Far Eastern Commission</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">McCoy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-08-28">August 28, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In accordance with instructions of August 23, 1946, from the State–War–Navy
                    Coordinating Committee, there is enclosed a statement of United States policy
                    regarding A Definition of the Relationship Between the Far Eastern Commission
                    and the Supreme Commander for the Allied Powers, comprising the substance of the
                    Appendix of SWNCC 297/3, which was approved by the State–War–Navy Coordinating
                    Committee on August 21, 1946, after amending.<anchor n="84" xml:id="d244-f1"
                    /></p>
                <p>The United States Member, Far Eastern Commission, is advised that the statement
                    of United States policy is furnished for his assistance and that it is not
                    believed desirable for him to introduce or discuss this paper as a whole in the
                    Far Eastern Commission.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ernest</hi> A. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Gross</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >for</hi><signed><hi rendition="#italic">J. H.
                    Hilldring</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d244-a1.xml" xpointer="d244-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d244-f1" n="84" xml:id="d244-f1-content">
                <p>SWNCC in its memorandum SWN–4693, August 23, 1946, informed the Department that
                    the Joint Chiefs of Staff had been requested to forward the Appendix of SWNCC
                    297/3 to the U.S. Representative on the Allied Council for Japan for his
                    personal information and guidance (740.00119 Control (Japan)/8–2346).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
